[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine coolant temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890643\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the engine coolant temperature sensor and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034175.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the coolant temperature sensor\ninto the threaded seat on the thermostat.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>ENGINE COOLANT TEMPERATURE SENSOR.</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine coolant temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890643\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]